@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #2E2640
skinparam ClassBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ClassHeaderBackgroundColor #E6F0FB
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam InterfaceBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam NoteBorderColor #855EDE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F4EFFC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F0FB
skinparam ActorBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam NodeBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam ArtifactBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam StateBorderColor #2E2640
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
left to right direction
component "Source connectors" as C
component "Event stream" as ST
component "Bronze store" as B
component "Conformance jobs" as S
component "Quality monitor" as Q
component "Dimensional model" as G
component "Purchasing dashboard" as D
C --> B
C --> ST
ST --> S
B --> S
S --> G
G --> D
S ..> Q
G ..> Q
note bottom of B
  <b>Volume</b>
  partitioned by source and date,
  history kept in object storage
end note
note top of ST
  <b>Velocity</b>
  micro-batches every 5 min
  for sales events
end note
note top of C
  <b>Variety</b>
  one connector per source,
  schema contract at the boundary
end note
note bottom of Q
  <b>Veracity</b>
  grain, range and arrival checks,
  quarantine rate monitored
end note
note top of D
  <b>Value</b>
  KPI traced to block 4
  of the Data Model Canvas
end note
@enduml
